to the ErrorCode enum. This was necessary to signal conflicts when attempting invalid state transitions (like confirming a cancelled shipment).\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added confirm() method with @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\"). The method:\n   - Looks up shipment by ID and throws ResourceNotFoundException if not found (404)\n   - Checks if status is CANCELLED and throws ConflictException with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE (409)\n   - Transitions CREATED → CONFIRMED (or keeps CONFIRMED unchanged)\n   - Saves the result and returns ResponseEntity.ok() with 200 status\n   All this follows the existing controller patterns.\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added four test methods covering the four cases specified in the ticket. Each test follows the existing pattern of setting up fixture, performing action, and verifying both status code and response body shape.\n\n**Unresolved findings**: None. The implementation fully addresses all requirements.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that confirms shipments idempotently, rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409, and unknown IDs with 404.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt — added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code\n              ShipmentController.kt — added confirm() endpoint method\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt — added four test cases for the new endpoint\n\nTests         confirms a created shipment and persists the status — verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and persistence\n              idempotent confirm of already confirmed shipment — verifies retry succeeds with 200 and no state change\n              rejects confirm of cancelled shipment with 409 — verifies conflict error with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE code\n              rejects confirm of unknown shipment with 404 — verifies not found error with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n\nVerification  ./mvnw test — BUILD SUCCESS, all 17 tests passing (9 shipment tests including 4 new ones)\n\nNot done      nothing — all acceptance criteria satisfied\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3331,"cache_read_input_tokens":22140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3331},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"969fcd24-fa87-4b9e-9b05-c60a5353853d","uuid":"e944afc1-0ae6-4630-a030-59fd991a768f","timestamp":"2026-09-15T18:52:03.152Z","request_id":"req_011Cf5jFHRdztAaFqA7SgA3n"}
